    "task": "In response to multiple inquiries about corporate mobile phone management, handle the required corporate mobile phone scenarios as requested and generate a complete `company_mobile_phone_management_policy.doc` handbook for onboarding training, day-to-day consultation responses, and frequently asked questions.",
