    "task": "Based on the downloaded warehouse management policies, prepare `warehouse_core_operation_standard_manual.doc` by integrating the key requirements for inbound operations, outbound operations, inventory control, and daily warehouse management, highlighting the linked rules and shared principles across each stage to help newcomers quickly master the core warehouse standards.",
