      "Does `quotation_analysis.md` correctly state that in Plan 2, the Office base quotation changed from 300 accounts to 400 accounts?",
      "Does `quotation_analysis.md` correctly state that in Plan 2, the number of product accounts also changed from 300 to 400?",
