      "Is there a complete distinction between HRBP and traditional HR in the three major categories of organizational dimension, service dimension, and personal dimension, each dimension containing at least 3 specific points of difference?",
      "Do the differences in organizational dimensions include five specific points of comparison: organizational form, functional positioning, starting point, focus point, and sense of speed?",
      "Do service dimensional differences include five specific points of comparison: service depth, service accuracy, service density, sensitivity, and experience?",
      "Does the difference in individual dimensions clearly indicate the comparison between traditional HR's tendency to be a solo expert and HRBP's tendency to be a collaborative managerial talent?",
      "Are the nine core responsibilities of HRBP fully listed in the implementation: process optimization, staffing, talent development, team planning, team motivation, organizational design, cultural implementation, cadre management, performance, all nine responsibilities are not missing?",
      "Does the embodiment accurately distinguish between CoE, HRBP, and SSC positioning metaphors: CoE is artillery/aviation, HRBP is special forces/scout, and SSC is infantry. Is the positioning metaphor accurate and not confused?",
      "Is the three synergistic logic clearly described in the implementation: HRBP found a first-line problem→ CoE design solution→ HRSSC performed standardized operations to form a closed loop?",
      "Is the implementation plan clearly divided into three training stages: 0-3 months role integration period, 3-6 months deep intervention period, and 6-12 months value creation period?",
      "Are the core objectives, learning content and key actions clearly given in each stage of training, and are the three stages structurally complete?",
      "Are there five core competency development frameworks included in the implementation: business understanding, HR expertise, solution skills, communication influence, and data skills, one for each of the five competencies?",
      "Does the 0-3 month period explicitly require the output of a list of business unit personnel, core job interview records (at least 5), and HRBP role cognitive learning notes?",
      "Does the 3-6 month phase explicitly require the output of a Needs Diagnostic Report, Talent Map, and Key Job Interview Question Bank?",
      "Is the 6-12 month period explicitly required to output the manpower health report, the improvement project plan summary, and the work case precipitation?",
