      "Is the calculation method for the store sales task completion rate of the operation position recorded as R = store actual sales / store target sales, R < 85% is awarded 0 points, R ≥ 85% is awarded 40 * R points, with a maximum of 40 points?",
      "Does the customer service supervisor position include 6 indicators including store sales task completion rate (30 points), conversion rate (20 points), customer unit price (10 points), comprehensive after-sales service (20 points), team building (10 points), and work report (10 points), and the total score is 100 points?",
      "Is the team building indicator for the customer service supervisor position 10 points? Is it calculated as 10 points for ≥3 training sessions, and 3.5 points will be deducted for each missed session?",
      "Does the after-sales specialist position include a total of 6 indicators: comprehensive after-sales score (30 points), refund dispute rate (20 points), refund completion time (10 points), refund completion rate (10 points), after-sales cost (20 points), and work report (10 points), and the total score is 100 points?",
      "Is the after-sales specialist’s after-sales cost indicator calculation method limited to 0.5% of sales, with 5 points deducted for every 0.1% exceeded?",
      "Does the customer service position include 6 indicators including sales target completion rate (40 points), inquiry conversion rate (20 points), refund rate (10 points), response speed (10 points), customer unit price (10 points), and daily work (10 points), and the total score is 100 points?",
      "Is the standard score for the response speed indicator of customer service positions 10 points? Is the calculation method based on the average response speed standard of 25 seconds, with 2 points deducted for every 5% delay?",
      "Does the promotion specialist position include a total of 12 records of three types of promotion indicators: through train, diamond exhibition, and Taoke, with a total score of 300 points?",
