      "Does the art position include four indicators: monthly plan completion rate (30 points), production efficiency (20 points), production quality (20 points), and temporary work cooperation (30 points), and the total score is 100 points?",
      "Is the calculation method for art production quality indicators such that no points will be deducted for feedback A, 2 points will be deducted for feedback B, and 3 points will be deducted for feedback C?",
      "Have the unit price indicators been merged and deduplicated when multiple positions appear? Only one record will be retained for the same position?",
