      "Does the summary table of performance coefficient rules in the output document completely list the four performance coefficient values ​​corresponding to the four score intervals, among which ≥95 points correspond to coefficient 1.5?",
      "Does the training and learning analysis in the output document include: In the novice stage (1 month), the assessment points of the operations assistant/store manager assistant are back-end operation capabilities?",
      "Is the attendance consistency analysis in the output document clear: the point deduction standard for all positions is the same, 2 points/day will be deducted for unexcused absences, and 1 point/day will be deducted for valid leave?",
      "Does the conclusion section of the output document summarize the five advantages of the assessment system: clear quantification of indicators, unified and standardized structure, reasonable weight distribution, flexible additional mechanism, and clear elimination mechanism?",
      "Does the output document include a complete summary table of core assessment indicators for each position, covering a total of 10 positions including store manager, operations, marketing department director, shipping department director, customer service director, customer service specialist, after-sales specialist, promotion specialist, artist, and financial director?",
