      "Does the output table contain complete data showing Zhitongche spending rising from RMB 97,500 to RMB 145,900 with ROI stable at 1.8-2.4, and Diamond Booth spending rising from RMB 110,200 to RMB 172,400 with ROI improving from 0.8 to 1.6?",
      "Does the output table fully cover the 6 key KPI indicators for the operations-assistant role, with accurate weights for each item, such as title and category 10%, on-time new-product listing rate 10%, and product-description page approval rate 10%?",
      "Does the output table fully cover the performance-evaluation system for the four roles of website editor, customer-service specialist, event specialist, and promotion specialist/BD?",
      "Does the output table clearly state that the four frontline roles, such as website editor, all use the weighting structure of 20% capability + 30% attitude + 50% performance?",
