      "Does the output table propose the specific adjustment suggestion of raising the product-description accuracy weight for the operations-assistant role from 10% to 15%?",
      "Does the output table propose the weighting-structure adjustment suggestion of changing frontline business roles to 15% capability + 25% attitude + 60% performance?",
      "Does the output table propose adding core business indicators such as promotion ROI, natural-traffic growth rate, activity participation rate, and member repurchase rate?",
      "Does the output table propose optimizing the scoring rules by adding a rule that major errors receive doubled deductions?",
      "Does the output table require each role to submit a monthly work plan and summary, and include them in the department's execution assessment?",
