      "Does the review accurately state that Multi-Property Synthesis proposes a symbolic fixed-point algorithm and uses monotonicity to achieve speed improvements of up to two orders of magnitude (100x)?",
      "Does the review include an abstract of the Proc3D paper, pointing out that the core problem is that existing 3D generated representations are not editable, limiting iterative design?",
      "Does the review accurately state that Proc3D's Procedural Compact Graph (PCG) reduces the token length by 4-10 times compared to Blender's native code, and the compilation rate reaches 89%?",
      "Does the review include an abstract of the SpaceHMchat paper and clearly indicate that the research background is the three major challenges of exploding labor costs, flooding of text information, and operational complexity brought about by satellite mega-constellations?",
      "Does the review accurately list the core experimental results of SpaceHMchat on 23 indicators: 100% working status identification conclusion accuracy, 99% + anomaly detection tool calling success rate, 89.43% fault location accuracy, knowledge retrieval <3 minutes?",
      "Did the review analyze how the multi-attribute synthesis method changes the AI planning paradigm, from all-or-nothing to gradually partially satisfied, and can find the maximum achievable goal set when resources conflict?",
      "Did the review discuss the application of multi-attribute synthesis in space mission failure re-planning, which can maximize the use of remaining resources in the event of instrument failure?",
