    "task": "Based on the existing product research data of AI learning assistants (Excel table format), analyze user pain points, user characteristics, functional satisfaction and other information, and complete the entire process of project establishment report and PRD writing for the new function of \"AI learning assistant\" for a B2C online education app. Output the AI_Learning_Assistant_PRD_v1.0.docx and AI_Learning_Assistant_Project_Proposal.pptx files in the same directory of the product research data folder.\nPRD requirements: include complete business background and OKR goals (payment conversion rate from 8.2% → 11%), user portraits and usage journeys, detailed functional module requirements (P0/P1/P2 classification), non-functional requirements (performance, security, cost), Freemium business model design, data burying plan, launch milestones, risk countermeasures\nProject report requirements: including cover + table of contents (dark color design), data pain points (4 big number statistics cards && embedded table: user pain point issues.\nBoth the PRD and PPT are signed by Zhang Yuan and dated March 12.",
